OL,3,GNEWSABoat removed from water as police
OL,4,Asearch for Carrie Mullane
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe search for Limerick woman Carrie
OL,7,FMullane is continuing in Northern
OL,8,FIreland.
OL,10,FThe PSNI believe the 39-year-old woman
OL,11,Fwas murdered after she arrived in
OL,12,FEnniskillen on 10 October.
OL,14,FSearches for her body are continuing in
OL,15,Fa number of areas including Lough Erne.
OL,17,FA small boat which was recovered from
OL,18,Funder the water beside Tullyinnishmore
OL,19,Fjetty outside Enniskillen was removed
OL,20,Ffrom the scene on board a barge on
OL,21,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
